o=A.dE(a9,B.m,"Room 204 keeps losing Wi-Fi. It goes out for about a minute, comes back, and then does it again \u2014 maybe four or five times an hour. All of the Chromebooks in the room do it at the same time. Room 206 next door is fine. This started Tuesday and it is making the online practice tests impossible to finish.",B.l4,a,!1,B.cl,!0,"7:40 AM",B.m)
